WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Are you interested in English, IT, or statistics?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Would you like to deepen your knowledge, or perhaps you simply need some practice?

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.000
My name is Dániel Mák,
and I am a Computer Science student at ELTE.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.500
When teaching English, I aim to help you gain
knowledge that you can use in real-life situations,

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.500
through practical scenarios
and realistic examples.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.000
In IT, I can help you with programming,
web development,

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.500
using office applications,
or even database management.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:41.000
If you need assistance with research,
you can also count on me for statistical analysis,

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.500
whether for dissertations, student research projects,
or scientific articles.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.000
If you feel that I could guide you towards the solution,
do not hesitate to get in touch with me.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Experience. Knowledge. Learning.